lcos-settings (1.1~dev) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First development snapshot of LCOS Command Center.
  * Display, desktop, appearance, window manager, notifications, removable
    media, accessibility, power, keyboard, mouse, sound, and default software.
  * Settings are stored in the xfconf channels used by the XFCE 4.20 tools.
  * Date and time, language, users, and startup. Privileged changes use pkexec.

 -- LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 20:40:00 +0000
